  "description": "✨ Create timeless, elegant, and heartwarming nursery designs with this premium Vintage Nursery Watercolor Clipart Bundle – a beautifully curated collection of soft storybook-inspired illustrations designed for baby rooms, nursery wall art, children’s decor, baby shower invitations, printable art, scrapbooking, branding, and more. Featuring charming teddy bears, sweet bunnies, whimsical toy trains, circus tents, sailboats, floral baskets, vintage toys, and classic nursery scenes, this bundle captures the perfect heirloom nursery aesthetic with muted pastel tones, delicate watercolor textures, and nostalgic storybook charm.\nPerfect for designers, small businesses, moms, nursery decorators, and creative entrepreneurs, these high-quality illustrations are ideal for creating baby milestone cards, wall prints, invitations, nursery posters, seamless patterns, stickers, planners, greeting cards, sublimation products, and timeless children’s decor. Designed with a soft gender-neutral palette of creams, dusty blues, sage greens, blush tones, and warm beige, this bundle works beautifully for both boys’ and girls’ nursery themes while maintaining an upscale vintage style. 🧸🎠🌸\n✨ What’s included:\n– 24 high-quality illustrations\n– Transparent background\n– High resolution (perfect for print & digital use)\n– 24 PNG files (transparent background)\n– 24 SVG files\n🧸 Perfect for:\n– Nursery wall art\n– Baby room decor\n– Baby shower invitations\n– Printable nursery posters\n– Storybook decor\n– Scrapbooking\n– Junk journals\n– Greeting cards\n– Branding\n– Sublimation\n– Stickers\n– Canva projects\n– Seamless patterns\n– Digital products\n🎠 Included illustrations: charming vintage teddy bears, elegant nursery bunnies, sweet geese, fluffy lambs, baby deer, classic elephants, whimsical carousels, dreamy hot air balloons, rocking horses, sleeping bunnies on crescent moons, storybook mushroom houses, vintage toy sailboats, floral wreaths, alphabet blocks, crib mobiles, baby carriages, teddy bears playing tennis, adorable animals driving vintage cars, circus tents, toy trains, nautical sailboat wagons, and other timeless nursery-inspired watercolor designs.",
